{"id": "industry-learning", "status": "published", "category": "Research Focus", "title": "Industry Learning", "subtitle": "Learning about supply chains, local trust, and market entry through Taiwan–Arizona industry exchanges.", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/industry-learning-venture-cafe.png", "width": 810, "height": 542, "fit": "contain", "background": "#1c1813", "srcset": "/assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-810.webp 810w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Reflections from the event</h3><p>Grateful for the opportunity to observe and learn from the Arizona–Taiwan semiconductor and supply chain ecosystem conversation.</p><p>Special thanks to Taiwan delegation and Executive Director Steve Hsu for his generous guidance and for making this learning opportunity possible.</p><p>As an ASU Supply Chain graduate student with nine years of overseas experience, my key takeaway is that Taiwan-to-U.S. expansion is not only about technology or capital. It is also about rebuilding visibility, trust, local partnerships, and operational readiness in the U.S. market.</p><p>Another meaningful observation was meeting several entrepreneurs and professionals who also operate across Japanese-speaking business environments. With Arizona, Taiwan, and Kumamoto building a more visible semiconductor collaboration framework, I see strong potential for future U.S.–Taiwan–Japan cooperation in supply chain, talent, and market-entry development.</p><p>I am still early in this journey, but I hope to keep learning and eventually become a useful bridge between Asian business execution and the U.S. supply chain ecosystem</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>Industry exchanges</h3><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact note-gallery-pair\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-mou-signing.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-mou-signing.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/industry-learning-mou-signing-ce4e8852835f-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-mou-signing-ce4e8852835f-812.webp 812w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Taiwan–Arizona industry cooperation MOU signing ceremony.\" width=\"812\" height=\"541\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Taiwan–Arizona industry cooperation MOU signing ceremony.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-venture-cafe.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-venture-cafe.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-venture-cafe-386859f2194a-810.webp 810w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Taiwan–U.S. industry exchange at Venture Café.\" width=\"810\" height=\"542\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Taiwan–U.S. industry exchange at Venture Café.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-event-dinner.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-event-dinner.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/industry-learning-event-dinner-7e5d26ccfb98-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/industry-learning-event-dinner-7e5d26ccfb98-959.webp 959w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"Group photo from the dinner that evening.\" width=\"959\" height=\"841\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>Group photo from the dinner that evening.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>With industry leaders</h3><p>Special thanks to Executive Director Steve Hsu for this opportunity to learn about the industry and meet experienced professionals.</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact note-gallery-trio\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-steve-hsu.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-steve-hsu.png\" alt=\"With Steve Hsu, Executive Director of the Arizona–Taiwan Trade and Investment Office.\" width=\"430\" height=\"565\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>With Steve Hsu, Executive Director of the Arizona–Taiwan Trade and Investment Office.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-james-huang.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-james-huang.png\" alt=\"With James Huang, Chairman of the Taiwan External Trade Development Council (TAITRA).\" width=\"432\" height=\"574\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>With James Huang, Chairman of the Taiwan External Trade Development Council (TAITRA).</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-chiao.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/industry-learning-chiao.png\" alt=\"With 喬培偉, President of 嘉惠集團.\" width=\"433\" height=\"570\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>With 喬培偉, President of 嘉惠集團.</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "pending": "Full article coming soon.", "close": "Close"}